      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEVINGS (1) jumped from a squeeze box last start but was quickly into stride and led throughout to score (19.69) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 340m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. The hardest to beat again. JUNGLE TIGER (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at The Gardens behind Smart Comet (23.40) in a Mix 2/3. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Hard to beat again. MICK THE MASTER (6) is a talented dog who is a winner of 35 races and filled a minor placing latest when second at this track (19.91). Has a good record here at this journey. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and five minor placings from 11 starts. Leading player again. DANNY WHIZZ BANG (7) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
